WEBVTT

00:26:29.948 --> 00:26:33.061
AG: Before the pandemic,
JaBarie Anderson was a freelance stylist.

00:26:33.085 --> 00:26:36.461
So when he tried doing virtual haircuts
from home about a month ago,

00:26:36.485 --> 00:26:38.336
he wasn't sure what to expect.

00:26:38.360 --> 00:26:41.488
JA: I've literally been in
so many bathrooms and showers

00:26:41.512 --> 00:26:42.679
with people now,

00:26:42.703 --> 00:26:44.262
and people turn on their camera,

00:26:44.286 --> 00:26:47.308
and it's just like people in their boxes
getting their hair cut.

00:26:47.332 --> 00:26:50.495
I'm like, "Oh, OK. This is happening."

00:26:50.519 --> 00:26:51.675
AG: Wait. That happens?

00:26:51.699 --> 00:26:53.150
JA: Yes, people are shirtless,

00:26:53.174 --> 00:26:56.911
or the whole family is in there watching,
talking like, "This is crazy.

00:26:56.935 --> 00:26:59.104
I want to see how this
is going to turn out."

00:26:59.128 --> 00:27:02.017
I'm like, "Turn your head this way.
Turn your head that way,"